    favorable: `"Settlement shall be based on the Hub price. Seller bears all nodal-to-hub basis risk. If the Project's node-to-hub spread exceeds $3/MWh in any month, Seller shall true up to Buyer within 30 days."`,
    unfavorable: `"Settlement shall be based on the ERCOT nodal price at the Project's delivery point. Buyer acknowledges and accepts all basis risk associated with nodal-to-hub price differentials."`,
