    favorable: `"During any Settlement Interval in which the Applicable Price is negative, the Applicable Price shall be deemed to be $0.00/MWh for purposes of calculating Settlement Amounts."`,
    unfavorable: `"Settlement Amounts shall be calculated using the actual Applicable Price for each Settlement Interval, including periods of negative pricing. Buyer acknowledges and accepts all negative price risk."`,
